{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/314cd28d36a72740374d658725098360.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neith</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> modular platform for productivity, note-taking, and everyday utilities. It brings together full-featured apps and quick-access widgets in one place, allowing you to build a workspace that adapts to your workflow. Each extension works independently but integrates seamlessly, creating a flexible and connected experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work privately on your PC for free, or sync your workspace across devices if you choose.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neith\u2019s extensions are divided into apps, full-featured productivity tools, and widgets, small utility tools for quick access. You can <strong>install</strong> exactly the tools you <strong>need</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Optional cloud sync is available through a paid plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/6f0d17fd6b57a828358da8050a97261c.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-featured apps for productivity, creativity, and organisation include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Text Editor: Write and format notes with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanban: Visual project and task management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Map: Brainstorm and organise ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopping List: Manage groceries and tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer Tools: Snippets, JSON formatter, regex tester, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diary: Journaling with reflection templates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes: Quick notes with a familiar, card-based layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >File Converter: Convert between multiple formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mood Board: Create visual mood boards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Todos: Manage tasks and to-dos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video Bookmarker: Save and organise videos with timestamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and many more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/8e54c6726f49fca4aa7a801085122c4c.poster.avif?t=1763988456\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/8e54c6726f49fca4aa7a801085122c4c.webm?t=1763988456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/8e54c6726f49fca4aa7a801085122c4c.mp4?t=1763988456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/035851c4ab1b1b0189e238182ffd36bc.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Widgets include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date: Beautiful date and time display with timezone support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egg Timer: Specialized timer for perfectly cooked eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Password Generator: Create secure passwords with customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Intake: Track daily water consumption with goals and reminders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Clock: Display time in multiple timezones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and many more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/f6e176cee7b6d6ab1028bffeff2cdd03.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neith is fully customisable and themeable, letting you express yourself while working. Choose from over 40 themes to create a workspace that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/66c20e475a04667f98fe489ff6548609.poster.avif?t=1763988456\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/66c20e475a04667f98fe489ff6548609.webm?t=1763988456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/66c20e475a04667f98fe489ff6548609.mp4?t=1763988456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/4e4bb3f1ead27b5692d036528d9551ae.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Will Neith be available on other platforms?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Yes! Other platforms are coming, including a mobile version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Do I need to buy Neith or pay for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Neith is free to use and lets you work privately on your PC. Cloud sync is available if you choose to use it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Do I need an account to get started?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> No. You can start using Neith immediately on your PC without creating an account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Will more apps and widgets come?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Yes! Neith is constantly evolving, and we\u2019ll be adding new apps and widgets over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Why release Neith on Steam?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Steam Early Access gives us a great way to reach users and gather feedback. You might encounter bugs along the way, and your input will help us build Neith together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1361410?t=1763988456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/67dfc656af4f214a9915a31e93f439ebaabee8a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763988456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/cda131fc17af5c81aaf3fac178216247dddd87db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763988456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/cda131fc17af5c81aaf3fac178216247dddd87db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763988456","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361410/extras/314cd28d36a72740374d658725098360.avif?t=1763988456\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neith</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> modular platform for productivity, note-taking, and everyday utilities. It brings t